---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ - Alberti Home Buyers LLC">
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">How long does the process take?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Our process is designed to be fast. From submission to closing, we can typically complete the sale in 7-14 days, but you can take longer if needed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Do I have to make any repairs?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            No. We buy houses in any condition. Whether your home needs cosmetic work, major repairs, or structural fixes, we'll buy it as-is.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Will there be any hidden fees?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            No. We're transparent about our process. There are no commissions, no broker fees, and no hidden costs. You receive the full offer amount.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">What if I have a mortgage or liens on the property?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            No problem. We can work with existing mortgages and liens. We'll handle the payoff, and you'll receive the net proceeds.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Is there any obligation when I submit my information?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            None at all. Submitting information is free and doesn't obligate you in any way. You're always free to decline our offer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">What types of properties do you buy?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            We buy all types of residential properties including single-family homes, multi-unit properties, condos, and properties in any condition.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Do you make firm offers?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Yes. Our cash offers are firm and not contingent on appraisals, inspections, or financing. You can count on our offer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-brand-purple/5 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">How do I get started?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Simply fill out the form on our website with your property information, and we'll contact you within 24 hours to discuss next steps.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 bg-brand-purple text-white p-10 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Still Have Questions?</h3>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block btn-primary px-8 py-3">
          Contact Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
